'''Vaal''' is a [[Human|human]] [[Non-Playable-Character|NPC]] [[Merchants|merchant]] that can be found at the crafting station near the [[Singing Crystal Mines]], located in [[Snowhill]]. She sells [[Miner]] [[Job]] related [[Items|items]].

==Sells==
*[[Open-Pit Miner Kerchief]]
*[[Open-Pit Miner Overalls]]
*[[Open-Pit Miner Helmet]]
*[[Open-Pit Miner Gloves]]
*[[Open-Pit Miner Boots]]
*[[Open-Pit Miner Shirt]]
*[[Miner's Flair Shard of Gold Rush]]
*[[Miner's Power Shard of Talent III]]
*[[Miner's Ring of Talent III]]
*[[Miner's Dynamite of Talent III]]

==Trivia==
*Vall was introduced in-game on the update of October 15, 2013.
